## 4️⃣ Exam Readiness Score

Button visible on all learner pages.
Enabled only if:
- User completed ≥ 3 mock tests.

Readiness Score Algorithm:
Based on:
- Average mock score
- Trend improvement
- Topic mastery %
- Consistency
- Time efficiency

Formula Example:
readiness = 
(0.4 × avg_score) +
(0.2 × trend_growth) +
(0.2 × topic_mastery) +
(0.2 × time_efficiency)

Display:
- Score out of 100
- Color indicator:
  - 0–50: Not Ready
  - 51–75: Moderate
  - 76–100: Exam Ready

Store in:
- readiness_scores table

